0375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper", "pages": [167]}], "matchEvidence": "Reviewed patient cases and question topics in the exact-recording transcript against the printed task paper; task filename alone is not used"}, {"id": "british-academy-task-14-B", "label": "British Academy · Task 14 · Part B", "part": "B", "sourceSha256": "0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc", "pages": [159, 160, 161], "questions": [{"number": 25, "prompt": "You hear a physician explaining Micro Laparoscopic Pain Mapping procedure to the\nnurse.\n\nThe endometriosis will be tender;\n\nA. While inserting a small bubble of gas inside the belly\n\nB. While touching with the laparoscope.\n\nC. When there is a pain.", "sourcePage": 159, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "C", "page": 167, "source": {"id": "offline-0300375e981d9b16a421", "filename": "Listening Tests 1 - 15.pdf", "sha256": "0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 26, "prompt": "You hear a physician discussing the role of Vitamin D in lung disease.\n\nWhich of the following statements is correct?\n\nA. Calcitriol regulates the concentration of potassium and calcium.\n\nB. Kidneys hydroxylate calcifediol\n\nC. Vitamin D is the hydroxylated form calcifediol", "sourcePage": 159, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "B", "page": 167, "source": {"id": "offline-0300375e981d9b16a421", "filename": "Listening Tests 1 - 15.pdf", "sha256": "0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 27, "prompt": "You hear a doctor explaining about the causes for Pyloric Stenosis in children\n\nWhich of the following statements is incorrect?\n\nA. Drinking alcohol during pregnancy increases the risk of pyloric stenosis in infants.\n\nB. First born boys are vulnerable to pyloric stenosis\n\nC. Newborn babies given antibiotics in the first fifteen days of their birth have the greatest risk.", "sourcePage": 160, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "B", "page": 167, "source": {"id": "offline-0300375e981d9b16a421", "filename": "Listening Tests 1 - 15.pdf", "sha256": "0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 28, "prompt": "You hear a doctor explaining issues caused by increased testosterone in\npostmenopausal women.\n\nWhich one of the following is not caused by a higher level of testosterone?\n\nA. High blood pressure\n\nB. Acne\n\nC. Increased bleeding during menstruation", "sourcePage": 160, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "C", "page": 167, "source": {"id": "offline-0300375e981d9b16a421", "filename": "Listening Tests 1 - 15.pdf", "sha256": "0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 29, "prompt": "You hear a doctor discussing about the methods to control narcotics use by the patient\n\nWhat if a patient gets a positive urine tox screen?\n\nA. Remind them not to use narcotics again.\n\nB. Contract with the patient will be terminated.\n\nC. The patient has to approach another clinic.", "sourcePage": 160, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "A", "page": 167, "source": {"id": "offline-0300375e981d9b16a421", "filename": "Listening Tests 1 - 15.pdf", "sha256": "0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 30, "prompt": "You hear a doctor debating about Nose inflammation, whether it is good or bad.\n\nWhich of the following statements best suits this extract?\n\nA. Nose inflammation repairs the tissues that allow us to smell.\n\nB. Chronic inflammation is bad for the olfactory system.\n\nC. Human body repairs by itself.\n\n                                              Part C\nIn this part of the test, you’ll hear two different extracts. In each extract, you’ll hear health\nprofessionals talking about specific aspects of their work.\n\nFor questions 31 to 42 choose the answer (A,B, or C) which fits best according to what you\nhear. Complete the answers as you listen the audio.\n\nNow look at extract one.", "sourcePage": 161, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "C", "page": 167, "source": {"id": "offline-0300375e981d9b16a421", "filename": "Listening Tests 1 - 15.pdf", "sha256": "0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}], "skills": ["listening"], "recordings": ["9b30c7a52c2dd9a4ae6eb5ea9eac07c0a9767d11259d5d75c4729499583b1634"], "answerSources": [{"id": "offline-0300375e981d9b16a421", "filename": "Listening Tests 1 - 15.pdf", "sha256": "0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper", "pages": [167]}], "matchEvidence": "Reviewed patient cases and question topics in the exact-recording transcript against the printed task paper; task filename alone is not used"}, {"id": "british-academy-task-14-C", "label": "British Academy · Task 14 · Part C", "part": "C", "sourceSha256": "0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc", "pages": [162, 163, 164, 165, 166], "questions": [{"number": 31, "prompt": "How long did the patient suffer from leukemia?\n\nA. Three & a half years\n\nB. Five years\n\nC. Four and half years", "sourcePage": 162, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "C", "page": 167, "source": {"id": "offline-0300375e981d9b16a421", "filename": "Listening Tests 1 - 15.pdf", "sha256": "0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 32, "prompt": "What did some neighbours used to do to him?\n\nA. They used to take the mick\n\nB. They harassed him\n\nC. They used to develop hatred on him", "sourcePage": 162, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "A", "page": 167, "source": {"id": "offline-0300375e981d9b16a421", "filename": "Listening Tests 1 - 15.pdf", "sha256": "0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 33, "prompt": "Classification of leukemia is made based on;\n\nA. The number of mutated white blood cells\n\nB. Speed of progression\n\nC. Symptoms", "sourcePage": 163, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "B", "page": 167, "source": {"id": "offline-0300375e981d9b16a421", "filename": "Listening Tests 1 - 15.pdf", "sha256": "0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 34, "prompt": "Which of the following types of leukemia requires aggressive and timely treatment?\n\nA. Lymphocytic leukemia\n\nB. Acute leukemia\n\nC. Chronic leukemia", "sourcePage": 163, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "B", "page": 167, "source": {"id": "offline-0300375e981d9b16a421", "filename": "Listening Tests 1 - 15.pdf", "sha256": "0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 35, "prompt": "Which of the following types of leukemia targets the mature blood cells?\n\nA. Chronic leukemia\n\nB. Acute myelogenous leukemia.\n\nC. Lymphocytic leukemia", "sourcePage": 163, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "A", "page": 167, "source": {"id": "offline-0300375e981d9b16a421", "filename": "Listening Tests 1 - 15.pdf", "sha256": "0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 36, "prompt": "Which of the following types of leukemia is caused by smoking?\n\nA. Lymphocytic leukemia\n\nB. Acute myelogenous leukemia.\n\nC. Chronic leukemia", "sourcePage": 164, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "B", "page": 167, "source": {"id": "offline-0300375e981d9b16a421", "filename": "Listening Tests 1 - 15.pdf", "sha256": "0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 37, "prompt": "Which one of the following is the destructive enzyme to the joint?\n\nA. Synovial fluid\n\nB. Red blood cells\n\nC. White blood cells", "sourcePage": 164, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "C", "page": 167, "source": {"id": "offline-0300375e981d9b16a421", "filename": "Listening Tests 1 - 15.pdf", "sha256": "0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 38, "prompt": "Presence of crystals may be indicated if the sample is;\n\nA. Moderately viscous\n\nB. Cloudy\n\nC. Less viscous", "sourcePage": 165, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "B", "page": 167, "source": {"id": "offline-0300375e981d9b16a421", "filename": "Listening Tests 1 - 15.pdf", "sha256": "0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 39, "prompt": "Increased level of protein in the sample indicates;\n\nA. Gout\n\nB. Bacterial infection\n\nC. Inflammation", "sourcePage": 165, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "B", "page": 167, "source": {"id": "offline-0300375e981d9b16a421", "filename": "Listening Tests 1 - 15.pdf", "sha256": "0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 40, "prompt": "An eosinophil count above 2% may indicate;\n\nA. Mycobacterial infection\n\nB. Lyme disease\n\nC. Bacterial infection", "sourcePage": 165, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "B", "page": 167, "source": {"id": "offline-0300375e981d9b16a421", "filename": "Listening Tests 1 - 15.pdf", "sha256": "0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 41, "prompt": "When gout crystals seen under a polarizing microscope are birefringent, then they\ndisplay;\n\nA. Yellow needle-like crystals, parallel to east-west in relation to the polarizing axis\n\nB. Red needle-like crystals when oriented with the north-south polarizing axis\n\nC. Blue needle-like crystals, parallel to east-west in relation to the polarizing axis", "sourcePage": 166, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "C", "page": 167, "source": {"id": "offline-0300375e981d9b16a421", "filename": "Listening Tests 1 - 15.pdf", "sha256": "0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 42, "prompt": "Degenerative effusions are characterized if the appearance of synovial fluid is:\n\nA. Opaque\n\nB. Hemorrhagic\n\nC. Clear", "sourcePage": 166, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "C", "page": 167, "source": {"id": "offline-0300375e981d9b16a421", "filename": "Listening Tests 1 - 15.pdf", "sha256": "0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}], "skills": ["listening"], "recordings": ["9b30c7a52c2dd9a4ae6eb5ea9eac07c0a9767d11259d5d75c4729499583b1634"], "answerSources": [{"id": "offline-0300375e981d9b16a421", "filename": "Listening Tests 1 - 15.pdf", "sha256": "0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper", "pages": [167]}], "matchEvidence": "Reviewed patient cases and question topics in the exact-recording transcript against the printed task paper; task filename alone is not used"}]}
